    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>Roll Brawn to strike an adjacent creature with a melee weapon for 2, 3 or 5 physical damage.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Maneuver</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self, one adjacent willing creature, or one adjacent hand-sized ordinary flame.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Recovery / Utility</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Reduce temporary Burning by 2. You may also extinguish an ordinary unattended flame small enough to cover with your hand.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785/design/cards/bank-the-embers.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/bank-the-embers.md</a> at <code>24e545e6d860e8c1b03a21356fd22cae1c039785</code>.</p></section>",
